# Frontend FSD

Import direction: `app → widgets → features → entities → shared` only.

## Where code lives
| Logic | Path |
|-------|------|
| API calls | `entities/*/api/` |
| useQuery/useMutation | `features/*/model/` |
| User actions UI | `features/*/ui/` |
| Composite blocks | `widgets/` |
| shadcn, client, utils | `shared/` |

## State
- Server data → TanStack Query (never duplicate in Zustand)
- UI filters/modals → Zustand or useState
- Forms → React Hook Form + Zod from `packages/shared`

## Never
- `fetch`/`axios` in components — use entity API + feature hook
- Import features from entities, or entities from shared
- Hardcoded colors — use design tokens from `docs/10-design-system.md`
- `useEffect` + fetch instead of `useQuery`

## Example
```tsx
// ✅ feature hook
const approve = useApproveRequest(requestId);
<Button onClick={() => approve.mutate()} />

// ❌ inline fetch in component
await fetch(`/api/v1/requests/${id}/approve`, { method: 'POST' });
```
